---
layout: layouts/base.njk
seoTitle: "Meaningful Psychiatry - Dr. Badeea Qureshi - Washington State"
description: "Psychiatrist in Washington State, blending professional expertise with a personal touch. Specializing in mental health care across diverse cultures."
bodyClass: home
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__inner">
    <img class="hero__photo hero__photo--left" src="/images/2024/09/Badeea_Qureshi_MD.webp" alt="Badeea Qureshi MD - Meaningful Psychiatry">
    <div class="hero__content">
      <p class="hero__banner">{{ site.acceptingBanner }}</p>
      <h1>Online psychiatry for children, teens, and adults across Washington State.</h1>
      <p class="hero__sub">Ages 8+ | WA residents | Medication management and psychotherapy | Private-pay and select insurance</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="/aetna-mental-health-provider-cost/" class="btn btn--wide">Check insurance and fees</a>
        <a href="{{ site.bookingUrl }}" class="btn btn--wide" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Request An Appointment</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <img class="hero__photo hero__photo--right" src="/images/2026/10/Francis_Agbotse2.webp" alt="Francis Agbotse, PMHNP">
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section class="features">
  <div class="feature">
    <div class="feature__head"><span class="feature__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-medical"></i></span><h3>Evidence Based Medicine</h3></div>
    <p>We aim to use evidence-based medicine to guide us in collaborating with you when arriving at a suitable medication regimen for your psychiatric needs. At times, certain individuals may respond better to medications that may not be first line for a particular disorder, this will always be discussed with you. In certain cases, medications may not be indicated, and may provide a greater risk than benefit, in these cases we can discuss the clinical decision making process and other supports.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature feature--gold">
    <div class="feature__head"><span class="feature__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-phone-volume"></i></span><h3>Schedule an Appointment</h3></div>
    <p>Contact us today to schedule an appointment.</p>
    <p><strong>Call or Text Us:</strong></p>
    <p><a href="{{ site.phoneLink }}"><strong>{{ site.phone }}</strong></a></p>
    <a href="/contact-us/" class="btn btn--navy">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
  <div class="feature">
    <div class="feature__head"><span class="feature__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-holding-medical"></i></span><h3>Tailored Treatment Regimens</h3></div>
    <p>At Meaningful Psychiatry, our goal is to ensure we address your mental health needs from multiple angles. This includes medication management, individual psychotherapy, drawing on social supports and resources, and recommendations for somatic therapies and alternative medicine modalities if applicable.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section class="mission">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Meaningful Psychiatry</p>
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>Our mission at Meaningful Psychiatry is to broaden the definition of mental health care by embracing the full spectrum of the human experience. We believe in zooming out, exploring beyond the surface, and understanding the intricate connections between the mind, body, and spirit.</p>
    <p>We approach mental health as part of the entirety of the patient’s life, recognizing the interplay between psychological well-being, physical health, and spiritual fulfillment.</p>
    <p>Rooted in a deep understanding of cultural diversity and personal growth, we strive to create a compassionate and inclusive environment where every patient feels seen, heard, and valued. At Meaningful Psychiatry, we empower our patients to achieve balance, resilience, and authentic fulfillment in every aspect of their lives.</p>
    <ul class="check-grid">
      <li>Holistic Healing</li>
      <li>Global Awareness</li>
      <li>Purposeful Conversations</li>
      <li>Full Picture of Health</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="center"><a href="/contact-us/" class="btn">Contact Us</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <p class="eyebrow">Integrative Approach</p>
      <h2>Specialty Medication Management Services</h2>
      <span class="rule"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="spec-grid">
      {%- for s in specialties %}
      <div class="spec-card">
        <i class="{{ s.icon }}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ s.text }}</p>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="center"><a href="/contact-us/" class="btn">Contact Us</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Integrative Approach</p>
        <h2>Special Interests in Psychotherapy</h2>
        <span class="rule rule--left"></span>
      </div>
      <p>Dr. Qureshi embraces a compassionate and integrative approach to mental health, recognizing the spiritual and psychological dimensions of challenges related to finances, sexual health, and personal relationships. Her dedication to understanding both the micro and macro aspects of the human experience enables her to offer a uniquely profound and empathetic form of care.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="interest-slider" data-slider>
      <div class="interest-slider__track">
        {%- for s in interests %}
        <a class="interest-card" href="/service/{{ s.slug }}/">
          <span class="interest-card__icon"><img src="{{ s.icon }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
          <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ s.text }}</p>
          <span class="interest-card__foot"></span>
        </a>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="interest-slider__dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose slide"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

